cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the paper and this repository."
title: "BPF-Ext: Safely Extending the eBPF Compilation Pipeline with Native Operations (artifact)"
abstract: >-
  Artifact for the accepted ATC 2026 paper "BPF-Ext: Safely Extending the eBPF
  Compilation Pipeline with Native Operations" (accepted paper #1160). Contains
  the benchmark harness, the bpfopt bytecode optimizer and stock-kernel userspace
  shim, the KOperation kernel modules, and the Lean 4 semantic-proof suite, plus
  the evaluator guide in docs/atc26-artifact-evaluation.md.
